    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d565">

                <pb facs="0555" n="383" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg383"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/8019</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hartman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-08T08:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 8, 1917, 8 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 4 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In note received last night [Minister of] Foreign Affairs advises me that Ecuador
                    has broken off diplomatic relations with Germany, <pb facs="0556" n="384"
                        xml:id="pg384"/> canceled exequaturs of German consuls in Ecuador, recalled
                    Ecuadoran Consul from Berlin, and ordered Dr. Wilhelm Mueller to leave the
                    national territory, handing to him police passports at the same time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
